  "overview": "MUI Material UI — Dark (#121212) canvas, Roboto typography, #fff brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Dark (#121212) canvas paired with `#121212` component surfaces and `#f7f7f8` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#fff` with `#000000` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Roboto` across 2 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
